  "description": "So Quirky! Puzzle Escape Game: Snap It in with Your Instincts! A Brain-Training Picture-Match Puzzle is a brain-training puzzle game where you look at a single displayed image, then drag and drop the correct item from four choices to solve the puzzle.\n\nWait, that one?! Actually, yeah — that makes total sense!\n\nPacked with wonderfully off-beat puzzles that put your intuition and quick thinking to the test.\n\nNo complex controls. No walls of text.\nJust look, think, and snap it into place!\nWhether you're killing time on the go or sparking lively reactions with friends on stream, anyone can jump in for a blast — a party-style puzzle experience for everyone.\n\n※Button controls are also supported, so you can play in TV Mode and Tabletop Mode too.\n\n———————————————\nTT supports gameplay streamers.\nNo permission from TT is required for gameplay streaming, whether personal or commercial.",
